==German==
{{wikipedia|Mauer (Begriffsklärung)|lang=de}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈmaʊ̯ər/|[ˈmaʊ̯ɐ]}}
* {{rhymes|de|aʊ̯ɐ}}
* {{audio|de|De-Mauer.ogg|Audio}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|gmh|mūr, mūre}}, from {{inh|de|goh|mūra}}, from {{der|de|la|mūrus||wall}}. Related to {{cog|en|mure}} and {{cog|yi|מויער}}.

====Noun====
{{de-noun|f||Mauern|Mäuerchen|dim2=Mäuerlein}}

# a [[wall]], usually one made of [[stone]] or [[concrete]]

=====Usage notes=====
* See {{m|de|Wand}} for notes on the distinction between ''Mauer'' and this sometimes interchangeable word.

